$date
  WaveCrux all-5-decoder coexistence fixture
$end
$version
  generate_multi_coexistence_fixture.dart
$end
$comment
  Combined SPI + I2C + UART + AXI4-Lite + APB bus fixture for the
  "all 5 Open Core decoders simultaneously" coexistence scenario.
  Each scope is copied verbatim from its own single-bus source fixture
  under verification/fixtures/protocol/<decoder>/generated/, with
  identifier codes remapped so none of the 5 buses collide. Decoding
  each bus over the combined file reproduces its source
  expected_transactions.json exactly.
$end
$timescale 1 ns $end
$scope module spi_tb $end
$var wire 1 ! sclk $end
$var wire 1 " mosi $end
$var wire 1 # miso $end
$var wire 1 % cs $end
$upscope $end
$scope module i2c_tb $end
$var wire 1 $ scl $end
$var wire 1 & sda $end
$upscope $end
$scope module uart_tb $end
$var wire 1 ' tx $end
$var wire 1 ( rx $end
$upscope $end
$scope module axi4lite_tb $end
$var wire 1 ) ACLK $end
$var wire 1 * ARESETn $end
$var wire 32 + AWADDR $end
$var wire 1 , AWVALID $end
$var wire 1 - AWREADY $end
$var wire 32 . WDATA $end
$var wire 1 / WVALID $end
$var wire 1 0 WREADY $end
$var wire 4 1 WSTRB $end
$var wire 2 2 BRESP $end
$var wire 1 3 BVALID $end
$var wire 1 4 BREADY $end
$var wire 32 5 ARADDR $end
$var wire 1 6 ARVALID $end
$var wire 1 7 ARREADY $end
$var wire 32 8 RDATA $end
$var wire 2 9 RRESP $end
$var wire 1 : RVALID $end
$var wire 1 ; RREADY $end
$upscope $end
$scope module apb_tb $end
$var wire 1 < PCLK $end
$var wire 1 = PRESETn $end
$var wire 32 > PADDR $end
$var wire 1 ? PWRITE $end
$var wire 32 @ PWDATA $end
$var wire 32 A PRDATA $end
$var wire 1 B PSEL $end
$var wire 1 C PENABLE $end
$var wire 1 D PREADY $end
$var wire 1 E PSLVERR $end
$var wire 4 F PSTRB $end
$var wire 3 G PPROT $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
